    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) today hosted the closing ceremony of the 2024 edition of the AKU President's Challenge for Climate Solutions, marking the culmination of a months-long competition that brought together student innovators from Pakistan, Kenya, Uganda and Tanzania in a bid to tackle one of the world's most pressing environmental issues: water.",
